WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,710
Got it

2
00:00:00,760 --> 00:00:02,040
Wait until Jian Tong arrives in Donghuang

3
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,280
I spread the sleeping pills in the hot water

4
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:05,000
Let him drink it and

5
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,700
I'll make arrangements for him and we'll know later.

6
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:08,940
Keren is in Donghuang

7
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:09,900
In the public relations department again

8
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:12,740
You can't leave it on, right? There will be gossip after a long time.

9
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:14,100
Who gets hot by gossiping?

10
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:15,260
I also need to teach you this

11
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:18,590
You are the big boss anyway

12
00:00:18,590 --> 00:00:19,670
You have the final say

13
00:00:19,670 --> 00:00:20,870
Take the whole Donghuang to play with

14
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,200
It’s also your business, Jian Tong

15
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:35,260
Come to my office silly girl

16
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:36,380
don't blame me

17
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:38,300
I dare not stop following the big boss’s orders

18
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:41,120
But it's really time for you to take a rest, okay?

19
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:42,940
drink some water first

20
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:47,770
Thank you, Sister Meng

21
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:48,850
I'm so thirsty

22
00:00:48,850 --> 00:00:50,210
Sister Meng, you are so kind

23
00:00:50,210 --> 00:00:52,170
If you only knew what's in the water

24
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:56,260
Wouldn't you say I'm a nice person? Is there any more, Sister Meng?

25
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:57,260
Yes, yes
